{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-09-30 08:00:00', 'title': 'U.S. CUSTOMS AND BORDER PROTECTION AWARDS LEIDOS OVER $200 MILLION TO PROVIDE SCREENING PORTALS TO PROTECT U.S. BORDERS', 'text': 'RESTON, VA., SEPT. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEIDOS\xa0(NYSE:LDOS), A FORTUNE® 500 SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER, WAS AWARDED A NEW PRIME CONTRACT BY U.S. CUSTOMS AND BORDER PROTECTION (CBP) TO PROVIDE LOW-ENERGY PORTAL (LEP) SYSTEMS FOR NON-INTRUSIVE INSPECTION (NII) OF PASSENGER VEHICLES AT U.S.-MEXICO LAND BORDER CROSSINGS.'}